1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,360
Yeah, I noticed,
but fire's no problem for me.

2
00:00:05,360 --> 00:00:08,740
As I was saying, Green
Lantern can do anything.

3
00:00:08,740 --> 00:00:10,520
Except shut up, apparently.

4
00:00:10,520 --> 00:00:14,380
Wow, someone forgot to take
their true blood tonight.

5
00:00:14,380 --> 00:00:15,530
I'm not a vampire.

6
00:00:15,580 --> 00:00:16,530
Seriously?

7
00:00:16,580 --> 00:00:20,770
I thought with the darkness and the
vanishing, then the what, super strength?

8
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:22,320
No.

9
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:27,660
Can you fly?

10
00:00:27,660 --> 00:00:29,200
In a plane.

11
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:33,400
Wait, you're not just some
guy in a bat costume, are you?

12
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:40,800
Are you freakin' kiddin' me?

13
00:00:43,120 --> 00:00:43,720
What?

14
00:00:43,620 --> 00:00:49,070
Nobody asked you to prom, so now you dress as
a bat and prowl around your parents' basement?

15
00:00:49,120 --> 00:00:51,120
What's this do?

16
00:00:51,120 --> 00:00:52,580
Huh?

17
00:00:52,580 --> 00:00:53,630
No buttons.

18
00:00:53,680 --> 00:00:56,260
I assume it works off concentration.

19
00:00:56,260 --> 00:00:57,760
How'd you do that?

20
00:00:59,360 --> 00:01:01,440
You weren't concentrating.

21
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:06,160
You won't do that again.

22
00:01:06,160 --> 00:01:07,600
Unless I want to.

23
00:01:07,600 --> 00:01:10,160
That's it! Let's rumble, spooky!

24
00:01:29,440 --> 00:01:31,540
Pull fast, we need more info.

25
00:01:34,640 --> 00:01:36,910
Oh crap, that's a bomb
and he just armed it!

26
00:01:36,960 --> 00:01:38,960
Lantern, wait!

27
00:01:39,520 --> 00:01:41,520
For Darkseid!

28
00:01:52,720 --> 00:01:54,720
Darkseid, what's that, a band?

29
00:01:54,720 --> 00:01:56,720
Some kind of death cry.

30
00:01:56,720 --> 00:01:58,670
They wanted to take us with it.

31
00:01:58,720 --> 00:02:00,720
I'll to protect this.

32
00:02:00,720 --> 00:02:02,720
I'm on it!

33
00:02:02,720 --> 00:02:04,720
Ring, scan and identify.

34
00:02:06,720 --> 00:02:08,720
Initiating scan.

35
00:02:08,720 --> 00:02:10,720
Processing.

36
00:02:12,720 --> 00:02:14,720
Unable to identify.

37
00:02:14,720 --> 00:02:15,670
That's impossible!

38
00:02:15,720 --> 00:02:19,920
The ring knows what the guardians know
and the guardians know everything.

39
00:02:20,720 --> 00:02:23,670
It doesn't scan like a bomb,
more like an alien computer.

40
00:02:23,720 --> 00:02:26,720
Alien, like the guy in Metropolis?

41
00:02:26,720 --> 00:02:28,720
Superman.

42
00:02:28,720 --> 00:02:30,720
You've met him?

43
00:02:30,720 --> 00:02:32,720
No. But I've researched him.

44
00:02:32,720 --> 00:02:34,720
His power levels are...

45
00:02:34,720 --> 00:02:36,670
Not gonna be a problem for me.

46
00:02:36,720 --> 00:02:38,720
We'll see.

47
00:02:38,720 --> 00:02:42,720
In the meantime, we need to
know more about this thing.

48
00:02:47,720 --> 00:02:49,670
Nothing on the markings
of the design, Sarah?

49
00:02:49,720 --> 00:02:51,720
No, Dr. Stone.

50
00:02:51,720 --> 00:02:54,670
Dozens of tests and we're still
unable to learn a single thing.

51
00:02:54,720 --> 00:02:58,670
We know less now than when the
Flash brought it to us days ago.

52
00:02:58,720 --> 00:03:01,870
Maybe we'll catch a break
with the metal scan.

53
00:03:04,720 --> 00:03:07,670
You've been working around
the clock on this, Silas.

54
00:03:07,720 --> 00:03:09,670
Perhaps if you got some rest.

55
00:03:09,720 --> 00:03:16,370
I'll rest when we know what this device is and why
that creature needed it planted in Central City.
